{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "5f3837791e15cf8c74746d8f716337788684cb1be1ac73b6ed06d74f75721521", "ja": "すこやかな輝きの影で", "zh": "活力四射的光芒背后", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "be3b3875c93e3e9294c350720e44abb1bcd01e914f423e39bc52784cd7fa917a", "ja": "元気にユニットの宣伝をかねた活動を続ける\n昴と紗代子。しかし、ついに黒井社長の妨害\nと思われる事件が発生し、メンバーは不安に\nつつまれる。その頃美希は、黒井社長と会っ\nていたのだった……。", "zh": "昴与纱代子活力充沛地跑活动，\n并为团体公演宣传造势。然而，\n还是发生疑似黑井社长妨碍的事件，\n使得不安的气氛笼罩着成员们。\n同一时刻，美希去和黑井社长见面……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a5e447ff278a6f81524bce99bec1589dd60461589919c20c57779d6be3ec4636", "ja": "（今日は昴と紗代子が野球のイベント、千鶴さんと\n朋花がTVの撮影と、それぞれ別の予定がある）", "zh": "（今天昴和纱代子有棒球活动，\n而千鹤和朋花则是参加电视录影，分开跑行程。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_04_1001_p", "source_sha256": "486e1d98b7de931d53be03b3b8f5366e51e69e06f12c54f494df8a2651009fde", "ja": "（しっかりユニット公演の宣伝をしていきたい\nところだが、黒井社長のことが気にかかるな……）", "zh": "（虽然想要好好宣传团体公演，\n但又很担心黑井社长会不会妨碍……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_04_1002_047sub", "source_sha256": "593dfd194cd9f0a9f8cb0a117deb6f84be48c0f83a15f8d755bc459cd86720ee", "ja": "なあ、{$P$}……\n今日って、本当に大丈夫かな？", "zh": "我问你喔，{$P$}……\n今天真的没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_04_1003_p", "source_sha256": "116025c77dae6da2b7549b0a4a96febbf74c1fe424a17d9542d8e981a23a08c9", "ja": "大丈夫って、黒井社長のことか？", "zh": "没问题？你是指黑井社长的事情吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_04_1004_047sub", "source_sha256": "8f04eb0a4928db7d0b6019d65d31c19a6d67dd0f6a5bf119b7dc13debd060e15", "ja": "うん……。せっかくあの人と仕事できるのに、\n邪魔されたら、やだな～……。", "zh": "嗯……难得有机会能跟那个人共事，\n我不想被人妨碍啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_04_1005_027say", "source_sha256": "f2cfe76d19bee125158d217597e6accb8b925da257b1845ddc58bbdbcf7c7b1c", "ja": "昴ちゃん、あの人って言うのは？", "zh": "小昴，你说的那个人是谁呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_04_1006_047sub", "source_sha256": "dc7c136aaf6fad60ea2e02ad5aa139264762aef3de4fa9119acec2a973f913c6", "ja": "今日の始球式で、オレが投げる相手だよ！　もう引退\nしちゃったんだけど、女子野球の元日本代表でさ！", "zh": "就是今天开球典礼要敲我球的打者！\n虽然她已经退休了，但以前是女子棒球的日本国手喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_04_1007_047sub", "source_sha256": "01edaa75de5ec41ef7fd57fb577b528eebe36c641547c9e4eb2511ebdc144935", "ja": "オレ、すごく尊敬してて……今日は同じグラウンドに\n立てるって、ずっと楽しみにしてたのに……はぁ……。", "zh": "我非常尊敬她……一直很期待今天和她\n站在同一个球场，可是……唉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_04_1008_p", "source_sha256": "10d0fe3537e6d18fc59b9c9f35d1bdea10fd1e230121669dcc0dd110689d2def", "ja": "（昴、ナーバスになってしまっているな……\nよし、ここは……！）", "zh": "（昴变得很紧张……\n好，现在我该……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_04_1009", "source_sha256": "ea6569276863f18ec15eee70eadbd260356b97b38da2cf6522d7b28a984c78b3", "ja": "話題を変える", "zh": "改变话题", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_04_2000_p", "source_sha256": "b0d6d7c899037430d2fe664ec3e8638b607c6aedb394cdcc720666db92e40f71", "ja": "昴、その人って、現役時代はどんな選手だったんだ？\n詳しくないから、教えてくれないか。", "zh": "昴，那个人现役的时候是怎样的选手呢？\n这方面我不太熟悉，可以跟我说吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_04_2001_047sub", "source_sha256": "69528b8d8a7ed3425c9beb9ec904ce5bf8128ba25d58c10fd433124ffceba3e6", "ja": "え？　どんなって……えっと……\nすごくうまい選手だったよ！　スターって感じで！", "zh": "咦？怎样的选手啊……我想想……\n她是很厉害的选手喔！是个棒球明星！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_04_2002_047sub", "source_sha256": "045697496fcec39d3f65edc268b83c87c2761ed409bc17578ed881fd9fb40fcf", "ja": "男子顔負けのパワーで、カキーンってよくスタンドまで\nボールを飛ばしててっ。それに守備も完璧でさ……！", "zh": "她的力气比男生还大，常常铿地一声就把球\n打到观众席上。而且守备也很完美……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_04_2003_027say", "source_sha256": "c684704866e519a44e65d7a078f82e4aabe57b47e2361d51d35dd2efa470f7c3", "ja": "うふふ、昴ちゃん、その人のことが\n大好きなんだね？　話してるとき、本当に楽しそう！", "zh": "呵呵，看来小昴很喜欢那个人吧？\n你讲起她时看起来真的很开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_04_2004_047sub", "source_sha256": "ce45214825ffc62ce51e22de30c8759fc6500895c336be13274b934618eafba9", "ja": "え、えへへ……まあなっ♪\nだって、本当にオレの憧れなんだもん……。", "zh": "嘿、嘿嘿……对啊♪\n因为我真的很崇拜她……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_04_2005_027say", "source_sha256": "bb13ae74f5153ffdfa1a2c962d9cdb7b6ea3f45f80ae32b671b3141b8aae30a2", "ja": "だったら余計に、暗い顔してたらダメだよ！\nその人のためにもね。", "zh": "既然这样，你现在就更不该沮丧了！\n这也是为了她喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_04_2006_047sub", "source_sha256": "eae5ecce4c70644d959672adac5a29a5bf781dd5a4903847a5faa600b2feb1aa", "ja": "う、うん……そうだよな……\n全力で投げなきゃ、あの人に失礼だよな……でも……。", "zh": "嗯、嗯……说得也是……\n我要全力投球才行，不然就太对不起她了……可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_04_2007_p", "source_sha256": "c896ec8f6134b3dff615fb122e040ee318e6e5240bd37086bb5d8893887a99e3", "ja": "昴、黒井社長のことなら心配するな。入場時の\n手荷物検査や、備品のチェックも徹底してるから。", "zh": "昴，黑井社长的事情你不用担心。\n入场时会做好随身物品的安检，用具也都检查过了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_04_2008_p", "source_sha256": "82141f5297350fa996f9c1a73d53969cde55de3ae7c0f1dfe27dde4fac735a30", "ja": "好きにさせるつもりはない。\n昴は何も心配せず、楽しんでこい！", "zh": "我不会让他为所欲为。\n昴，你完全不用担心，开心去投球吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_04_2009_047sub", "source_sha256": "826971885367b93fa2dc1a99754f7e40283bf016992bd077923334c895b0c7bc", "ja": "{$P$}……うん、わかった！\n黒井社長なんかに負けないように、頑張るよ！", "zh": "{$P$}……嗯，我知道了！\n我会加油的！才不会输给黑井社长呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_04_2010_027say", "source_sha256": "0b5ab2d423fe7861511eec41826fab28a2723811bfc267b213045590dddf81bd", "ja": "その調子！　あ、そうだ。レモンのはちみつ漬け\n作ってきたから、よかったら食べてね。元気が出るよ！", "zh": "这样就对了！啊，对了，我做了蜂蜜腌柠檬，\n你可以吃一点，打起精神！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_04_2011_047sub", "source_sha256": "47dc45677a127a09faec8287557c2f7d437a3b5826f82314b0f0cbbe8aa9b887", "ja": "マジで！？　あれ、おいしいんだよな～！\nサンキュー、紗代子！", "zh": "可以吗！？那个很好吃耶～！\n谢啦，纱代子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_04_2012_027say", "source_sha256": "b3f4f50f82da79d2c4071e79b01247c5e83023b240a4b633a0df57ec7d3e7b4a", "ja": "どういたしまして。今日の私は、\n昴ちゃんのチアガールだからねっ！", "zh": "不客气。\n今天我就是小昴的啦啦队！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_04_2013_p", "source_sha256": "7165a4335ce28a439e300f08ec20173b60b67f26e68fb5fa094b363fb11b49ac", "ja": "（その後、昴と『あの人』との白熱した勝負に客席は\n沸き、イベントは大盛況で幕を下ろした！）", "zh": "（之后，昴和『那个人』之间火热的对决\n令观众席热烈沸腾，活动在一片盛况中落幕！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_04_2014_p", "source_sha256": "96097d7e83cdcb55986854a98977893edd99a8f35a3dff319dc673c64550553c", "ja": "（そして俺は、ふたりを事務所まで送り届けてから、\n千鶴さん達が待つ現場へと移動したんだが……）", "zh": "（然后，我送她们俩回事务所后，\n就前往千鹤她们工作的现场……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_04_2015_038chz", "source_sha256": "fbba9990f8e74a05bfd437c35a42f706e2fec75e63340753d9374747f60003c6", "ja": "{$P$}！　大変ですわ！", "zh": "{$P$}！不好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_04_2016_p", "source_sha256": "9700b00a1d9b9472143505c0d847c1e757de7736e8ec5ba25ffbc893d0f765cf", "ja": "千鶴さん！？　どうしたんですか？", "zh": "千鹤！？发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_04_2017_031tom", "source_sha256": "b2ca1b0d05de03686575ec2c3d9cc90496f3103d634694c05ff47c8fcbd8f407", "ja": "実は……", "zh": "是这样的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_04_2018_p", "source_sha256": "e6f642768e95ab8b6b5a8ea6084dced6f9a6e049a911a1ae717187c9048b9bf8", "ja": "撮影で使うはずだったセットが全部水浸しに……！？", "zh": "录影用的布景全都泡水了……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_04_2019_038chz", "source_sha256": "d1ed963c902a0260e7335cc6ace2403a11b2f6f5b12f3219a9dcd1a09a7d4853", "ja": "ええ。幸い、似たようなセットをお持ちのスタジオが\n近くにあるので、撮影はできそうとのことですが……。", "zh": "是啊，幸好附近一间摄影棚有类似的布景，\n所以应该还是能继续录……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_04_2020_p", "source_sha256": "0c16d8d819e7484cd055b0e184017f32101967346037ac67bf182abcc00a4b4c", "ja": "そ、そうですか、よかった……！\nすぐに手続きをします！", "zh": "这、这样啊，太好了……！\n我马上去办手续！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_04_2021_031tom", "source_sha256": "862fe8386120b9546408231b2c91cfdb6bbb11734b15398f22a786ed90e97aac", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\nこれは黒井社長の仕業なのでしょうか～？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n这会不会是黑井社长做的好事呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_04_2022_p", "source_sha256": "bbcaa923ff7bbd95045a4d090b09b39e594672175f4a48ce3547347af5d909a0", "ja": "ひょっとしたらな……でも、さすがに急遽決まった\nスタジオにまで、ちょっかいはかけられないだろう。", "zh": "是有可能……不过，现在临时换了摄影棚，\n他应该无法再干扰了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_04_2023_p", "source_sha256": "5cb07c291dfe54a398340c0695013d4d59de76f35d0fbc260e70651415f6ad4c", "ja": "ひとまずふたりは意識を切り替えて、\n撮影に集中してくれ！", "zh": "你们俩先放下这件事，\n专注在录影上吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_04_2024_038chz", "source_sha256": "24fb2aa688df2e078905d10546c88906630cb302c4354916f8ccd668c91fdb1d", "ja": "わかりましたわ、お任せくださいまし！", "zh": "好的，交给本小姐吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_04_2025_null", "source_sha256": "de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481", "ja": "翌日……", "zh": "隔天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_04_2026_p", "source_sha256": "aea3de0791528d4434200eac1e1d552e09ccb612d8319596a08aee3562249dee", "ja": "（これからみんなで、ダンスの案を出し合うんだが、\n黒井社長の件で空気が重いな……）", "zh": "（现在大家要讨论公演的舞蹈，\n但因为黑井社长的事情，气氛相当凝重……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_04_2027_038chz", "source_sha256": "2ca440afe1ce026f27675812fa2a79f931861b5ac339d156fbcf5221d14e0433", "ja": "あら？　そういえば美希はどこに行ったのかしら？\n今日はミーティングがあると伝えたはずですが……。", "zh": "咦？话说回来，美希去哪里了呢？\n本小姐有告诉她今天要开会呀……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_04_2028_se", "source_sha256": "c0c6ed31d6efb9a717b25c539ac5d5e569c926444aaf7cae58377fd2f1f8933d", "ja": "ブルルル……！", "zh": "嘟噜噜噜……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_04_2029_p", "source_sha256": "3041a899dd957a131ba0e086aa34f29e746fb9321968f9d3977a2253368971a8", "ja": "（ん？　美希からメール……！）", "zh": "（嗯？美希传简讯过来……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_04_2030_003mik", "source_sha256": "bcccaa00bdfca972e4db78c6a2090034d61e08045ddc8da78ff6e56875a83dd9", "ja": "『よりみちするから\nミーティング遅れるね☆』", "zh": "『美希要先去其他地方，\n会迟点才去开会喔☆』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_04_2031_p", "source_sha256": "76d1c711846599a69c8a162a2a73b193fc1f964e2f88f0023c3755e5d65fae82", "ja": "（よりみち……？\nまさか961プロに行ったんじゃ……？）", "zh": "（其他地方……？\n该不会是去961艺能了吧……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_04_2033_p", "source_sha256": "52029a965b7c35a343688a3bb6353528254df6a46b317bb0e4698d125b85b26b", "ja": "（いや……考えすぎか？　でもこのタイミングは、\nどうしても嫌な想像をしてしまう……）", "zh": "（不……是我想太多了吗？但现在时机敏感，\n我会忍不住往坏处想……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_04_2034_027say", "source_sha256": "858905dff340256fc365842af6c82952c3466ab7947b07e45d5d5aa5b5166f01", "ja": "{$P$}、私達の……。\nミルキーウェイの公演、大丈夫ですよね……？", "zh": "{$P$}，我们的……\n『Milky Way』的公演，应该没问题吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_04_2035_p", "source_sha256": "a4efb5a7454d794a8e74c9e18c411d6af23460b53fcb7186e4506dd3e0c928c1", "ja": "（……いや、今はメンバー達のケアが先決だ！\n美希が無茶をしていないことを祈るしかない……）", "zh": "（……不对，现在应该先照顾其他成员！\n只能祈祷美希不会做傻事了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_04_2036_p", "source_sha256": "e7006154a7690ec79cdb963e5c99d6f6a97d21aab74438dc13fde9beb3774645", "ja": "……紗代子、不安なのはわかる。\nみすみす手出しを許したのは、俺が甘かった。", "zh": "……纱代子，我知道你很不安。\n是我太大意了，才会放任对方出手。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_04_2037_p", "source_sha256": "fdc251be16ffd403ed1fee9915e65e55e453ced1207ada8838adb404c6092ff5", "ja": "今後はもっと徹底して対処するから、みんなは仕事に\n集中してくれ。他でもない、ファンのために！", "zh": "以后我会彻底应对的，\n大家专注在工作上吧，这也是为了粉丝们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_04_2038_027say", "source_sha256": "2f9d9458afbbf2eb4062c0cf52d6afc6f50c47060bb402550a12e690d0ea0ed0", "ja": "ファンのため……。", "zh": "为了粉丝们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_04_2039_047sub", "source_sha256": "518ca3c029d358e50d3f3bccb323227ba163aa60e51ed4ed6f82a6000ae6bfe8", "ja": "へへっ、ステージにも全力投球しなきゃ、\nファンのみんなに失礼だもんな！", "zh": "嘿嘿！在舞台上也得全力投球才行，\n不然就太对不起粉丝了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_04_2040_027say", "source_sha256": "2cdc647b735230c08a4b532cc5a04c1eacfc8a361bb3003b7a171deae2f620f9", "ja": "昴ちゃん……うん、そうだよね！\n私達が不安がってちゃ、お客さんに申し訳ないよね！", "zh": "小昴……嗯，你说得对！\n我们要是带着不安上场，对观众就太失礼了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_04_2041_027say", "source_sha256": "69f258245f69c78a439430c4ba29ce3c0d72e20ae5d56639cde3ed87b7a6a598", "ja": "みんな、黒井社長なんかに振り回されないで……\n公演のことだけ考えよう！　私達ならやれるよ！", "zh": "大家，不要被黑井社长那种人给干扰了……\n专注在公演上吧！我们一定办得到！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_04_2042_p", "source_sha256": "39b440c52c3a8356ec4a102d0d6f77480a22df183dfe2f12d517cc448aa167eb", "ja": "（ファンを大切に想う気持ちが、みんなを奮い立たせて\nくれたみたいだ……よかった）", "zh": "（对粉丝的重视似乎\n提振起大家的士气了……太好了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_04_2043_p", "source_sha256": "1babf69bab52368482da4716c13b0f1b4da650723e371519a8fba615b1d42b83", "ja": "（にしても、美希はいったい、どこに……？）", "zh": "（话说回来，美希究竟上哪去了……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_04_2044_kuroi", "source_sha256": "05fea1e2105fa406eacbeca1a6f119e07096df1372fc25740c5f8c533a0a3b8d", "ja": "……美希ちゃん、よく来てくれたね。まあかけたまえ。\nこれからの話をしようじゃないか……クックック！", "zh": "……美希，你真的来啦。先坐下来吧。\n让我们谈谈以后的事吧……呵呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
